{"chapters":[{"title":"Simulate minute by minute","code":"def oranges_rotting(grid):\n    g = [row[:] for row in grid]\n    m, n = len(g), len(g[0])\n    minutes = 0\n    while True:\n        rot = [(r, c) for r in range(m) for c in range(n) if g[r][c] == 1 and any(\n            0 <= a < m and 0 <= b < n and g[a][b] == 2\n            for a, b in ((r + 1, c), (r - 1, c), (r, c + 1), (r, c - 1)))]\n        if not rot:\n            break\n        for r, c in rot:\n            g[r][c] = 2\n        minutes += 1\n    return -1 if any(1 in row for row in g) else minutes","frames":[{"caption":"<strong>Simulate minute by minute</strong> &mdash; O((m &middot; n)&sup2;) time, O(m &middot; n) extra space. Input: <code>oranges_rotting(grid=[[0, 2]])</code>. Step through to watch the code work on this input.","line":1,"panels":[{"t":"arr","id":"grid","label":"grid","v":["0,2"],"cls":[""]}],"vars":[],"stack":[]},{"caption":"<code>g = [row[:] for row in grid]</code> &mdash; <code>row = [0, 2]</code>","line":2,"panels":[{"t":"arr","id":"grid","label":"grid","v":["0,2"],"cls":[""]},{"t":"arr","id":"row","label":"row","v":["0","2"],"cls":["",""]}],"vars":[],"stack":[]},{"caption":"<code>g = [row[:] for row in grid]</code> &mdash; <code>g = [[0, 2]]</code>","line":2,"panels":[{"t":"arr","id":"grid","label":"grid","v":["0,2"],"cls":[""]},{"t":"grid","id":"g","label":"g","v":[["0","2"]],"cls":[["",""]]}],"vars":[],"stack":[]},{"caption":"<code>m, n = len(g), len(g[0])</code> &mdash; <code>m = 1</code>; <code>n = 2</code>","line":3,"panels":[{"t":"arr","id":"grid","label":"grid","v":["0,2"],"cls":[""]},{"t":"grid","id":"g","label":"g","v":[["0","2"]],"cls":[["",""]]}],"vars":[["m","1",1],["n","2",1]],"stack":[]},{"caption":"<code>minutes = 0</code> &mdash; <code>minutes = 0</code>","line":4,"panels":[{"t":"arr","id":"grid","label":"grid","v":["0,2"],"cls":[""]},{"t":"grid","id":"g","label":"g","v":[["0","2"]],"cls":[["",""]]}],"vars":[["minutes","0",1],["m","1",0],["n","2",0]],"stack":[]}